# Assets excluded from the Cloudflare Workers upload for the cf.doesitarm.com
# preview. They stay in static/ for the build; they are just not served here.
#
# The SSR pages and the client fetch the LIVE external API at api.doesitarm.com
# (PUBLIC_API_DOMAIN), so the bundled same-origin /api/ snapshot (~730 MB,
# ~6,300 files) is redundant for the preview. The endpoint manifests and big
# data JSONs are build inputs / exceed the 25 MiB Workers asset cap.
api/
app-bundles.json
video-list.json
eleventy-endpoints.json
sitemap-endpoints.json
nuxt-endpoints.json
